{"id": "ae924ce29bbfc50e", "field": "text", "ja": "この地域の脅威をすべて我々だけで片付けることはできない。もう一人、戦う手が欲しいところだ、{name}。", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-gossip-sg3@2026-09-15", "imported": "2026-09-15"}, "english": {"hash": "ae924ce29bbfc50e", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
